    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d87">

                <pb facs="0205" n="175" sameAs="frus:frus1952-54Guat/pg175"/>

                <head>87. Telegram From the Central Intelligence Agency
                    to PBSUCCESS
                        Headquarters in Florida<anchor n="1" xml:id="d87-f1"/></head>
                <dateline><placeName>Washington</placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                        when="1954-01-27T21:37:00+00:00">January 27, 1954, 2137Z</date>.</dateline>
                <p>35910. Ref: DIR 21969.<anchor n="2"
                        xml:id="d87-f2"/> For purposes PBSUCCESS program and to help support ODYOKE position forthcoming OAS Conference Caracas, urge all
                    stations your jurisdiction give top priority obtention solid evidence of
                    Guatemalan support of subversion or interventionist activities neighboring
                    countries as requested ref.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
